  "body": "To download the property documents, please visit: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/LEW2\r\n\r\nOur owners are ready for retirement living, creating an exciting opportunity for buyers looking for something a little different. This contemporary townhouse delivers modern design, easy-care living and a location benefiting from significant investment.\r\nSet on its own 458sqm freehold section, the property offers privacy, security and, importantly, additional land alongside the home providing exceptional off-street parking. There's plenty of room for multiple vehicles, a boat, camper or other recreational toys, setting this property apart from the typical townhouse offering.\r\nDownstairs, lovely open-plan living combines a modern kitchen with excellent natural light and all-day north-facing sun. Double glazing, two heat pumps and underfloor heating in both bathrooms ensure year-round comfort, while the covered rear deck with outdoor blinds provides a private spot to relax or entertain. Upstairs are two generous bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. An internal-access garage with laundry adds convenience and storage, while an optional stair lift can remain as part of the chattels if required.\r\nWith no body corporate fees, this is an appealing lock-and-leave option, equally suited to those seeking a comfortable home or a smart investment.\r\nBeaches, parks, schools and local shopping are all close by, with the ongoing development of Penlink set to further enhance connectivity and the appeal of this location.\r\nModern, low-maintenance living with exceptional parking and flexibility, 21 Sanremo Lane deserves your attention.",
